|OpenForum.persistObject|id: string|void|—|Mark object state to persist|
|OpenForum.storePersistentState|key?|void|—|Save persisted object values|
|OpenForum.restorePersistentState|key?|void|—|Restore persisted values|
|OpenForum.addListener|id, fn|void|—|React to object changes|
|OpenForum.bind|a, b|void|—|Bind two objects or object→fn|

