!!! 🔧 Debugging & Testing
* __OpenForum.setDebugToConsole(true)__ – enable logging  
* __OpenForum.testing.showComments()__ – overlay comments  
* __OpenForum.testing.showIds()__ – overlay IDs  
* __OpenForum.testing.showNames()__ – overlay names  
* __OpenForum.testing.readForm() / writeToForm(data)__ – form helpers  

